{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00091",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.77,
      "end_seconds": 2.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "Hello again. Come on in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.68,
      "end_seconds": 4.43,
      "duration_seconds": 0.75,
      "text": "Hi. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.82,
      "end_seconds": 6.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Did you take the bus in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.67,
      "end_seconds": 10.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "I drove. The roads were quiet today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.29,
      "end_seconds": 14.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "What was the main thing you wanted to talk about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.98,
      "end_seconds": 21.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Doctor, it's fever with chills. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.56,
      "end_seconds": 28.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.51,
      "text": "How long have you had it? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.39,
      "end_seconds": 36.57,
      "duration_seconds": 7.18,
      "text": "About... well, about two weeks. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.52,
      "end_seconds": 40.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Right, does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.56,
      "end_seconds": 46.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get nausea as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.47,
      "end_seconds": 50.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Have you had any cough or rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.23,
      "end_seconds": 53.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "No, uh, none of those."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.31,
      "end_seconds": 57.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Any diarrhoea, vomiting or stiff neck at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.49,
      "end_seconds": 60.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "No, none of that at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.09,
      "end_seconds": 63.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.39,
      "end_seconds": 66.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.85,
      "end_seconds": 69.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.59,
      "end_seconds": 71.44,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.18,
      "end_seconds": 90.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.02,
      "end_seconds": 95.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "I had my thyroid operated on a long time ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.87,
      "end_seconds": 97.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.35,
      "end_seconds": 106.83,
      "duration_seconds": 7.48,
      "text": "So, you know, busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.49,
      "end_seconds": 111.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.89,
      "end_seconds": 114.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Aspirin. I come out in... well, wheezing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.18,
      "end_seconds": 117.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.92,
      "end_seconds": 125.52,
      "duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "text": "Asthalin inhaler. I take it when needed for my asthma. Paracetamol. I take it when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.65,
      "end_seconds": 128.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "Do you know the dose?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.5,
      "end_seconds": 130.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "It's 500 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.45,
      "end_seconds": 134.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.78,
      "end_seconds": 138.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.84,
      "end_seconds": 139.62,
      "duration_seconds": 0.78,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.86,
      "end_seconds": 143.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "I stopped smoking about two years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.5,
      "end_seconds": 148.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.84,
      "end_seconds": 154.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "So, I've had asthma, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.65,
      "end_seconds": 161.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "Mm-hm. Right, so that's your known asthma. We'll keep that in mind today. Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.07,
      "end_seconds": 176.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.43,
      "end_seconds": 208.42,
      "duration_seconds": 13.99,
      "text": "Okay: height 184 centimetres, BMI works out to 21.6, weight 73 kilos. And pulse is 105 beats a minute, temp 38.1 degrees, BP is 105 over 75. Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.12,
      "end_seconds": 221.99,
      "duration_seconds": 12.87,
      "text": "Yes, uh, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.96,
      "end_seconds": 227.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.43,
      "end_seconds": 229.13,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.23,
      "end_seconds": 232.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Tell me if anything hurts as I press."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.37,
      "end_seconds": 254.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "No rash anywhere on your body that I can see."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.52,
      "end_seconds": 256.22,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.61,
      "end_seconds": 263.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.48,
      "end_seconds": 268.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 268.93,
      "end_seconds": 269.82,
      "duration_seconds": 0.89,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.2,
      "end_seconds": 292.32,
      "duration_seconds": 16.12,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Okay, so my impression is this: It fits best with malaria until proven otherwise. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. It could also be dengue fever, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.83,
      "end_seconds": 296.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "Is this going to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.11,
      "end_seconds": 314.99,
      "duration_seconds": 17.88,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's malaria until proven otherwise, and we'll know more once the blood tests is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had fever with chills for about two weeks, and no diarrhoea or stiff neck."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.9,
      "end_seconds": 317.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.89,
      "end_seconds": 339.88,
      "duration_seconds": 21.99,
      "text": "I'm going to order blood tests, for fever. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. Let's get a malaria test, for fever after travel. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Let the lab know you travelled recently, that's important for the tests. Please take the tablets with food so they don't upset your stomach."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.16,
      "end_seconds": 353.88,
      "duration_seconds": 12.72,
      "text": "Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. Keep an eye out, and if you get confused, very drowsy, or the shaking returns, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.24,
      "end_seconds": 357.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Got it, um, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.25,
      "end_seconds": 361.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Let's review you after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 361.8,
      "end_seconds": 363.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "So, okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.44,
      "end_seconds": 370.67,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 371.59,
      "end_seconds": 376.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.64,
      "end_seconds": 384.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.61,
      "end_seconds": 387.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "So, no questions. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}